        "text": "Grid Storage Review 2026\n1. Summary\nNorthwind Energy added battery storage at three sites this year. The Zürich site now holds forty megawatt hours.\nThe sites are:\nZürich, with forty megawatt hours. Lyon, with twelve megawatt hours. Oslo, with eight megawatt hours.\n2. Operations\nEvery site reports its charge cycles each night. Faults are rare and are fixed within a day.\n2.1 Lyon\nThe Lyon site replaced two inverters in March. Its output rose by a tenth after the repair.\nFigures are rounded to the nearest megawatt hour."
      },
